internal/oracle/testdata/record_declared_keys_refused/g03_dictionary_argument.a:8:13: Adamic 0.1 refuses a dictionary bound as a type argument whose constraint reads it through a declared property narrower than its values (Dict as T, constrained to Options: outFile is declared string | undefined, and the index signature holds string | number | undefined); give the record no declared keys, or write the declared property by its name
